---
description: Ensure rigorous JSON contracts, provenance and lineage in domain models and runtime events
globs: '**/*.{json,jsonschema,py,ts,tsx}'
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use JSON Schema Draft 2020-12 where applicable; keep explicit schemaVersion and migration policy.
- Enforce every edge reference resolves to an existing graph node; reject broken or duplicated IDs.
- Carry packId, intentVersion, correlationId, runId, traceId, graphRefs, evidenceStatus, timestamp and dataClassification across handoffs.
- Never infer evidenceStatus='verified' from a successful schema check, simulation, synthetic data, or correlation.
- Keep board objective -> function -> signal/source -> hypothesis -> metric -> intervention -> capability -> partner action traversable.
- Do not mix customer value, partner billed revenue and Cisco product opportunity into one amount.
